```mermaid
graph LR
    %% Data Flow Diagram
    Client[Browser/Client]
    
    subgraph Frontend
        ReactUI[React Components]
        LocalState[Zustand Local State]
        Echo[Laravel Echo]
    end

    subgraph Bridge
        InertiaBridge[Inertia.js Protocol]
    end

    subgraph Backend
        Router[Laravel Router]
        Middleware[Middleware: Auth, Tenant, Role]
        Controller[Inertia Controller]
        Service[app/Services Domain Logic]
        Model[Eloquent Model]
        Reverb[Laravel Reverb WebSocket Server]
    end

    subgraph Storage
        Database[(RDBMS)]
        Cache[(Redis Cache)]
    end

    Client -->|Interaction| ReactUI
    ReactUI -->|Updates| LocalState
    ReactUI -->|Page Request/Form Submit| InertiaBridge
    InertiaBridge -->|HTTP| Router
    Router --> Middleware
    Middleware --> Controller
    Controller --> Service
    Service --> Cache
    Service --> Model
    Model --> Database
    Database --> Model
    Model --> Service
    Service --> Controller
    Service -.->|Broadcast Event| Reverb
    Reverb -.->|WebSocket Push| Echo
    Echo -.->|State Update| LocalState
    Controller -->|Inertia Response Page/Props| InertiaBridge
    InertiaBridge -->|Props Update| ReactUI
```
